{"lemma":"צָעַד","translit":"tsâʻad","pronunciation":"tsaw-ad'","def":"to pace, i.e. step regularly; (upward) to mount; (along) to march; (down and causatively) to hurl","kjv":"bring, go, march (through), run over.","occ":[[34,3,12,"Thou didst march through"],[9,6,13,"had gone"],[17,18,14,"and it shall bring"],[6,5,4,"when thou marchedst out"],[19,7,8,"and he went"],[18,68,7,"when thou didst march"],[23,10,5,"because they cannot go"],[0,49,22,"run"]]}